</style>
<p dir="auto">Zeus now keeps itself up to date.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Check for Updates…</strong> in the menu bar menu, and a daily automatic check you can turn off in Settings › General.</li>
<li>Settings › General shows the version you're running.</li>
<li>The message box grows as you type, up to six lines.</li>
<li>Settings shows the terminal command as <code class="notranslate">tmux attach -t zeus</code>.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
